            { 'MP and HP regen drinks.' },
            { 'Icarus Wing for each melee.' },
            { 'Food — mages may prefer pies over cookies for the larger MP pool, as resting time is limited.' },
            { 'A few CCB Polymer Pumps — make Omega and Ultima helpless for about 30 seconds each.', sub = {
