            { 'Click the door on the airship for a third cutscene and to begin the first fight.' },
            { 'The battle has a 45-minute time limit — you will likely use all of it.' },
            { 'Click the Iron Gate and enter the battlefield \'One to be Feared\'; buffs wear on entry — buff inside.', sub = {
