                { 'Trade a Snow Lily to Tarnotik at (K-10) in Oldton Movalpolos for a warp there.' },
                { 'Gamble with Twinkbrix at (E-13) in Oldton Movalpolos until winning Key Item Shaft 2716 Operating Lever, then pay 2000 gil to warp there.' },
                { 'The long way: walk through Newton Movalpolos operating furnace hatches (requires at least 3 people).' },
