            { 'Note: Zoning without checking the NM trigger for the post-fight cutscene resets the fight — you must refight the NM.' },
            { '── Boggelmann (Misareaux Coast) ──' },
            { 'Travel to (E-7) in Misareaux Coast and check the Storage Compartment to spawn the Bugard Boggelmann.', sub = {
