            { 'Head to Carpenters\' Landing via the east entrance in Jugner Forest (J-8).', sub = {
                { 'Survival Guide to Carpenters\' Landing is fastest; Unity Warp Level 119 also close; Abyssea - Vunkerl maw is nearby.' },
            } },
            { 'Travel to (I-9) and click the ??? near the water to spawn Cryptonberry Executor (NIN).', sub = {
                { 'Shortly after, 3 Cryptonberry Assassins (THF, SMN, BLM) appear.' },
                { 'All can use their respective 2-hour abilities; kill the Executor first and fast to avoid Mijin Gakure.' },
                { 'Astral Flow is the next concern but is weaker than the Executor\'s Mijin Gakure.' },
                { 'Keep HP high until the NIN and SMN are down.' },
