            { 'Check the ??? again after the Tonberries die for a cutscene.' },
            { '── Dalham (Bibiki Bay) ──' },
            { 'Travel to (F-6) in Bibiki Bay and click the ??? inside a cave to spawn the Kraken-type Dalham.', sub = {
                { 'Survival Guide and Unity Warp 119 are similarly close.' },
                { 'No 2-hour ability, though Hundred Fists may seem to apply by fight\'s end.' },
                { 'The \'Dust Cloud\' animation merely indicates Dalham is increasing attack speed, not a 2-hour.' },
            } },
            { 'Check the ??? after defeating Dalham for a cutscene.' },
            { '── Wrapping Up ──' },
            { 'Return to Cid after all three monsters are defeated to obtain Key Item Letters from Ulmia and Prishe.' },
            { 'Talk to Sueleen in Sealion\'s Den at (H-6), near Tavnazian Safehold Home Point #2, for a cutscene.' },
