            { 'MP and HP regen drinks.' },
            { 'Travel to Sealion\'s Den and click the Iron Gate for a cutscene.' },
            { 'Click the Iron Gate again and enter the battlefield \'The Warrior\'s Path\'.', sub = {
                { 'Uncapped, but buffs still wear off on entry — buff inside.' },
                { 'Once you enter, you cannot leave until you win or lose.' },
