            { 'Return to and examine the Crystalline Field to enter the Grand Palace of Hu\'Xzoi.' },
            { 'Examine the Gate of the Gods inside for a cutscene and your reward.' },
            { 'Touch the east Particle Gate at (H-8) for another cutscene to complete the mission.', sub = {
                { 'Register the nearby Home Point for future missions.' },
            } },
        },
