            { 'This fight is likely the longest; plan accordingly.' },
            { '── Fight 3: Alexander ──' },
            { 'Like Razfahd, cannot move during the fight.' },
            { 'Paladin-type: has Banish IV, Banishga III, Dia III, Holy II, and Mega Holy.' },
            { 'Abilities: Draw In (only when hate-holder moves too far), Radiant Sacrament (AoE, wipes Utsusemi, Magic Defense Down), Void of Repentance (Terror), Gospel of the Lost (heals 900-1,100 HP and removes debuffs; stunnable but very fast cast), Divine Spear (damage + Attack -25%), Divine Judgement (AoE 1,000+ damage, clears Utsusemi; used at 50% HP and again as health drops, preceded by "ΩΩΩΩΩΩΩ"), Perfect Defense (immune to all damage for a short time).' },
            { 'Battle ends once Alexander is defeated.' },
            { '── Wrap Up ──' },
            { 'If you fail, return to Naja Salaheem for another key item to try again.' },
            { 'If you win, you watch one last cutscene that finishes the mission.' },
