            { 'The mission ends when anyone in your party finds the exit.' },
            { '── Battlefield Navigation ──' },
            { 'Go northwest and hug the right wall; blow up the wall at (H/I-9), go through, then blow up the wall north at (H-8). Double back to kill the Goblin Reaver for 3 explosives (check the ??? once per explosive).' },
            { 'Blow up the wall southeast at (I-9), proceed northeast to the dead-end at (J-7), and examine the ??? for a cutscene + virtual Firesand temp item.', sub = {
