            } },
            { 'Do not use this route your first time experiencing Ulbuka — learn Survival Skills instead.', sub = {
                { 'A back route with minimal survival skills is possible if Escape can be used (often by subbing /BLM). From Morimar Basalt Fields southwest of WP #4, enter Woh Gates, then Escape to wind up at the end of Yorcia Weald close to WP #3.' },
