        starting_npc = 'N/A',
        subtitle     = 'Queen\'s Confidante',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Fate saw you meet with Rosulatia, the burnr seed of the leafkin. She has asked you to find a Yorcia\'s tear to learn about the abnormalities in Eastern Ulbuka. Find one and head to the sole pure font of water within the weald.',
        series       = 'Seekers of Adoulin',
        previous     = '',
        next         = '',
        walkthrough  = {

            { 'Obtain Key Item Yorcia\'s tear via one of two methods:' },
            { 'Option 1 — click the Ergon Locus ??? at the southern part of (I-8) in Yorcia Weald.', sub = {
                { 'Enter (I-8) from the West; a wall occasionally blocks the path and opens at 21:00.' },
                { 'A different Ergon Locus and ??? exist in the northern part of (I-8) but are not the correct location.' },
