                { 'Before approaching the big room, use Sneak + Invisible at a distance (or Silent Oil & Prism Powder): Bergschrund Gefryst aggros magic, Metalcruncher Worm aggros sound, and Serac Rabbit / Powdery Snoll aggro sight.' },
