                { 'Curaga on a Trust affects the entire group; on a PC it does not.' },
                { 'Fight is still won if all players die, provided NPCs finish the kills.' },
            } },
        },
        notes        = {

            { 'If you fail this BCNM, reacquire the Key Item Tuft of golden fur by examining the Large Animal Track at the (J-8)/(K-8) border in Woh Gates near the Yorcia Weald exit.' },
            { 'All party members currently on the Mission need the Key Item to enter; previous completers do not. Entry is denied if any party member lacks both.' },
