                { 'If unlocked, use Waypoint: Enigmatic Device -> Outer Ra\'Kaznar.' },
            } },
            { '── Scale Locations ──' },
            { 'Effigy of Sealing at (I-11), Upstairs Map 1 — Key Item Starblessed scale.' },
            { 'Silvery Plate at (C-7), Upstairs Map 1 — Key Item Silvery plate.', sub = {
                { 'Pick this up before the next scale; it enables the elevator at (I-6) Upstairs Map 1 to reach the last scale.' },
            } },
            { 'Effigy of Sealing at (H-2), Upstairs Map 1 — Key Item Moontouched scale.' },
            { 'Demonic Architrave at (C-8), Basement Map 2 — Key Item Sunkissed scale.', sub = {
                { 'Scales can be collected in any order, but the above order follows the natural zone flow.' },
                { 'Optional: each scale unlocks minor extra cutscenes at the Alpine Trail (H-5) in Kamihr Drifts and at Celennia Memorial Library; if skipped, view them later at the Goblin Footprint (K-11) in Kamihr Drifts and from Jedelaih in the Library. No bonus scene exists for two scales.' },
            } },
            { 'Once all four scales are collected, return to Kamihr Drifts Bivouac #3 (or Home Point) and examine the Alpine Trail at (H-5) for a cutscene and the Key Item World Tree sapling.' },
        },
    },
