            { 'Set The Arciela Directive Records of Eminence Objective.' },
            { 'Trade the requested sweets to Ploh Trishbahk to complete the Records of Eminence Objective.' },
            { 'Receive title Servant to the Servant and 50 Pinches of High-Purity Bayld.' },
            { 'Examine the Sandy Overlook at (J-10) in Ceizak Battlegrounds for a cutscene.', sub = {
                { 'Frontier Bivouac #1 is the closest warp from the castle\'s waypoint.' },
