        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Beyond the vortex a strange world unfurls--and it looks not unlike Zi\'Tah. The place may be what is called Escha. Follow the crystal\'s call to Holla, Dem, or Mea.',
