            { 'After the fight, examine the ??? again for another cutscene.', sub = {
                { 'Receive KI "Rhapsody in Azure".' },
                { 'If you "Call for Help" on Siren, you won\'t get the cutscene and must wait 1 minute for repop.' },
                { 'On death, you may re-zone and still receive the cutscene as long as Siren is defeated.' },
