        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: The Sirens and Iroha were able to capture the ambassador, claiming that only a communion can banish him (and subsequently Iroha and the future Siren), but Balamor intervened and whisked the ambassador away. Take Siren\'s gift to the crystals.',
