        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: You saw a vision of Iroha being overtaken by the Cloud of Darkness. Were all your efforts for naught? Is another struggle about to commence? Make haste for the crystal in Reisenjima.',
