        starting_npc = 'N/A',
        subtitle     = 'Blessed by the Avatars',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Fragments of the Cloud of Darkness remained in Reisenjima\'s crystal. The future is far from saved, and Iroha remains in this time. The avatars\' help is paramount. Head to the stone circle in La Theine Plateau.',
