        starting_npc = 'N/A',
        subtitle     = 'None',
        repeatable   = 'No',
        description  = 'Mission Orders: Having vanquished the Cloud of Darkness, you are certain that the future has been set on its proper course. Iroha has returned to her time, yet this is not the final goodbye. Someday, far in the future, you will be reunited once more.',
