        description  = 'Mission Orders: Iroha\'s future provides clues about the ambassador. The only way to combat his darkness is to gather more light for your orb. Your next destination is Adoulin. If necessary, speak with Darcia in Lower Jeuno to start the Seekers of Adoulin missions.',
