            { 'Yujuju — Port Windurst (M-6), by the Air Travel Agency, for Port Windurst scoop.' },
            { 'Return to Naiko-Paneiko; he will request that you check out a lead in the Inner Horutoto Ruins.' },
            { 'Enter Inner Horutoto Ruins from East Sarutabaruta (J-7).' },
            { 'Examine the Cracked Wall at (G-8) to enter the second map.', sub = {
                { 'The Cracked Wall at (G-9) is an alternative if you lack Invisible to avoid goblin aggro past the door.' },
            } },
            { 'Examine the Mahogany Door at (G-8) to confirm the Windurst Woods scoop key item.' },
            { 'Return to Naiko-Paneiko to finish the quest and receive your reward.' },
        },
        notes             = {

            { 'Low-level players: Incredibly Tough mobs (level 79-92) in Inner Horutoto Ruins.', sub = {
                { 'After Abyssea raised the level cap beyond 75, SE repurposed some low-level zones into level 75+ camps.' },
            } },
            { 'Regular wildlife (Beasts, Vermin, etc.) is non-aggressive — you can walk past them.' },
            { 'Evil creatures (Undead, Beastmen, Demons) remain aggressive and should be avoided.', sub = {
                { 'Sneak/Invisible usually not needed — look for alternative tunnels.' },
                { 'In Inner Horutoto Ruins, the southern tunnel marked B has no skeletons or goblins.' },
            } },
            { 'Look up Incredibly Tough mob levels on zone pages or the Grounds Tomes in middle-lands areas.' },
            { '── Summary ──' },
            { 'Deathwatch Beetle and Troika Bats — ignore them and they\'ll ignore you.' },
            { 'Goblins — Sight aggro; stay more than 10y away (roughly half the tunnel width), especially around (H-8).' },
            { 'Skeletons — Sound aggro and low-HP aggro (below 80%); stay more than 10y away, found near (H-8) past the goblins.' },
            { 'Aggressive enemies can be avoided without Sneak/Invisible by using the southern tunnel B and staying left toward the Mahogany Door.' },
        },
    },
