                } },
                { 'Do not confuse this with Gysahl Greens which are sold from the stables NPC. They do not work.' },
            } },
            { 'Feed the chocobo standing next to Osker one Gausebit Grass by trading it to the chocobo.', sub = {
                { 'It is possible to feed the chocobo once every real life minute.', sub = {
                    { 'Each "minute" starts at :00 (rather than counting from the last feeding interaction with the chocobo)' },
