            { 'Defeat the Soulflayer and examine the blank spot again for the final cutscene and your reward.', sub = {
                { 'If you zone after defeating the Soulflayer without the final cutscene, you must fight it again.' },
            } },
            { '── Blue Mage AF Armor Commission ──' },
            { 'After flagging Transformations you may commission Blue Mage AF from Lathuya in any order; new pieces available one Vana\'diel day after the last is completed.' },
            { 'Required ingredients: Gold Chain, Velvet Cloth, Flan Meat, Imp. Silk Cloth, Platinum Sheet, Velvet Cloth, Karakul Leather, Venom Potion, Velvet Cloth, Chimera Blood, Karakul Cloth, Imp. Silk Cloth.' },
            { 'Trade ingredients then pay in a second trade; receive a Magus order slip, return after the game day changes and zoning to receive your armor.' },
        },
