                { 'If you don\'t have Hatchets, buy them from Geltpix at (M-6) now — you\'ll need them later in this quest.' },
            } },
            { 'Return to Pashhow Marshlands (S) and examine the Shimmering Pondweed at (G-6) again for a cutscene.', sub = {
                { 'Campaign teleport is likely the fastest route.' },
                { 'Alternatively, Survival Guide to Rolanberry Fields (S) puts you near the Pashhow Marshlands (S) zone line.' },
            } },
            { 'Travel to Jugner Forest (S) and examine the Overgrown Mushrooms on the pathway at (F-10) for a cutscene.', sub = {
