            { 'Speak to Dhea Prandoleh in Windurst Waters (S) at (H-10); she should mention the Boss having her eyes on you.' },
            { 'Click the (left side) Door: Acolyte Hostel at (K-5) in Windurst Waters (S) for a cutscene with young Ajido-Marujido.', sub = {
                { 'Ground floor, not the second floor.' },
            } },
            { 'Go to Sauromugue Champaign (S) (F-6) and click the Bulwark Gate (where the Jeuno zone normally is) for a cutscene.' },
            { 'Trade the 108-Knot Quipu to the Bulwark Gate for another cutscene with Rachemace.' },
            { 'Click the Bulwark Gate for another cutscene with Rachemace.', sub = {
                { 'Click the Bulwark Gate until you trigger every cutscene; when it says "the door is firmly sealed" at least 3 times in a row, proceed.' },
            } },
            { 'Zone into Southern San d\'Oria (S) from East Ronfaure (S) for a cutscene with Pattna-Ottna.', sub = {
                { 'If mounted when entering, the cutscene won\'t trigger — exit and re-enter on foot.' },
                { 'Atmacite Refiner at the gate can Voidwatch warp to East Ronfaure (S) at the zone line if over level 75 (Voidwatch progress required).' },
            } },
            { 'Go past the Portcullis and click the first Door: House on the right at (M-8) in Southern San d\'Oria (S) for the final cutscene with Joseaneaut and your reward.' },
        },
    },
