        next_quest        = 'None',
        walkthrough       = {

            { 'Speak to Marin in Bastok Markets to accept the quest.', sub = {
                { 'Select "I wasn\'t talking to you, squirt!" when prompted to proceed.' },
            } },
            { 'Enter Dangruf Wadi for a short introductory cutscene.', sub = {
                { 'If you teleport via Survival Guide you must re-zone to receive this cutscene.' },
            } },
            { 'Speak to Ken inside Dangruf Wadi to initiate the escort.', sub = {
                { 'You will be capped at level 10.' },
                { 'Buffs remain active, but you cannot cast on Ken before starting.' },
            } },
            { '── Escort rules ──' },
            { 'You fail the mission if Ken spots you.' },
            { 'Ken engages every enemy in his line of sight; you must keep him alive.' },
            { 'He has reasonable survivability but is in danger after 3-4 enemies.' },
            { 'Ken cannot be stopped like the 3-nation escort NPCs.' },
            { 'He attacks unclaimed enemies even if another player has aggro; while attacking, his target appears unclaimed but outsiders cannot hit it.' },
            { 'His sight distance is considerable — be mindful of your position.' },
            { 'After a kill he snaps back to his path location, often turning abruptly and spotting you if you were curing from behind. He can pass normally impassable terrain.' },
            { 'He kills lizards/worms in 4-5 hits, goblins in ~5, crabs in 6-7. His accuracy is poor.' },
            { 'Tip: a higher-level friend can pull-kill ahead of Ken; stay out of sight and ready to cure. Once Ken engages, the friend cannot assist.' },
            { '── Escort route progression ──' },
            { 'Ken follows the same path each time. Messages indicate his progress along the route:' },
            { '1: "I have this funny feeling I\'m being watched..." — Ken stops and turns around; stay out of sight.' },
            { '2: "Uh-oh... I think I\'m lost..." — Ken pauses, then continues.' },
            { '3a: "Now, where should I begin my survey..." — Ken pauses, rotates 360, hums, then runs to the pond in the large central room.' },
            { '3b: "This looks like a good place... But I wonder if there is anything interesting further on..."' },
            { '4: "A dead end... I guess I\'ll go back to that other place." — Ken turns around; hide behind the southern rock.' },
            { '5: "Ah, here we are. Now let\'s see... Depth... Temperature..." — Ken takes a reading at the hot spring.' },
            { '6: "... What was that sound..." — Ken turns; stay out of sight.' },
            { '7: "Have I already been here..." — Ken runs in circles in the first room; stay far from the perimeter.' },
            { '8: "Huh. That was easy..." — Ken\'s route is finished.' },
            { 'Once Ken finishes, speak to Marin at the exit to remove the level cap and receive the Key Item Ken\'s escort award.' },
            { 'Return to Bastok Markets and speak to Marin again to finish the quest.' },
        },
    },
