            { '── Weather Tips ──' },
            { 'Check the top-left corner above your compass for the current weather (use /clock to toggle).' },
            { 'Red (Fire) is the most difficult; more frequent in summer months and around midday (12:00 noon).', sub = {
                { 'Use /clock to check the in-game month (toggle twice to keep your previous compass state).' },
            } },
            { 'Weather is uniform across a zone; some nearby zones share weather (e.g. Rabao, Western and Eastern Altepa Desert).', sub = {
                { 'Rabao isn\'t a Field area but works as a Home Point #1 hub to monitor desert weather.' },
                { 'Weather patterns are not always region-bound — e.g. Elshimo Uplands/Lowlands share with Yhoator/Yuhtunga Jungles and Kazham.' },
            } },
            { 'Firesday increases probability of fire weather (especially Altepa Deserts and Valkurm Dunes).' },
            { 'Scholar\'s Storm spells do NOT count.' },
            { 'Weather Forecast NPCs show current and next 2 game days; double-weather predictions are more accurate.' },
            { 'Dropping Carbuncle\'s Ruby before completion does NOT lose progress; just obtain another.' },
            { 'After Rain there is often Windy weather in La Theine Plateau.' },
            { 'Only expansive outdoor areas count; dungeon-like outdoor areas (Dangruf Wadi, Davoi, Ifrit\'s Cauldron) do not. Rule of thumb: if you can\'t use a mount, it won\'t count.' },
            { 'Identify Original/Zilart zones via region-related Records of Eminence quests or by setting Home Point/Survival Guide lists to "Select by expansion".' },
            { 'Once all 7 weather effects are experienced, receive a cutscene with Carbuncle directing you to La Theine Plateau.' },
            { 'Go to La Theine Plateau (G-6) and trade the Carbuncle\'s Ruby to the ??? for a cutscene to complete the quest.', sub = {
                { 'Optional: look to the sky around the Crag of Holla for a rainbow which appears when someone unlocks the Summoner job.' },
            } },
        },
    },
