            { 'Trade the Timeworn Talisman plus a Sutlac and/or Irmik Helvasi to Yoyoroon in Nashmau.', sub = {
                { 'Trading both foods with the talisman gives the highest appraisal success chance.' },
                { 'Sutlac and Irmik Helvasi are sold by Fayeewah and Yafaaf at the Shararat Teahouse in Whitegate.' },
                { 'Yoyoroon will not accept Sutlac +1 or Irmik Helvasi +1.' },
                { 'If appraisal fails, you must obtain another Timeworn Talisman and the food items again.' },
                { 'On success, zone and speak to Yoyoroon again to receive Key Item: Talisman of the rebel gods.' },
