            { 'After winning, choose your reward in the cutscene.' },
            { 'Examine Imperial Whitegate at Aht Urhgan Whitegate (L-8/9) for a cutscene to complete the quest.', sub = {
                { 'If you get the Trust: Nashmeira cutscene instead, finish it, then re-examine the gate to complete this quest.' },
