            { 'Guide the chocobo to the Repair Crate at (G-7) (tunnel near the Schnitter, not Inugami), avoiding all aggro.', sub = {
                { 'Silent Oil and Prism Powder on yourself still let the chocobo follow.' },
                { 'If a monster is in line-of-sight of the chocobo, it runs back to the last safe spot ("Kweh!?" appears in log).' },
                { 'If it runs, return and interact to stop it.' },
                { 'Recommended path: Stamina Apple at start; north to the dead end, turn left and walk slightly north of AT-04 Martello (watch for Dark Miasma); use Silent Oil before the next stretch (ambushes will scare the chocobo); hug the right wall through the rocks; pass AT-06 Martello; at the Schnitters, hug the far wall south into the tunnel to the target.' },
            } },
            { 'You will receive a message when the chocobo is close enough to be loaded.' },
            { 'Click the large Repair Trunk to gather supplies, then click the chocobo to load them.', sub = {
                { 'Selecting Depart prevents further loading and continues the escort.' },
                { 'Load only one supply if you just want to complete the quest — more slows the chocobo.' },
            } },
            { 'Guide the chocobo back to the Chocobo Tamer (Attohwa) and speak to them to complete the escort.', sub = {
                { 'Retrace your steps — it is the quickest way.' },
            } },
            { 'Talk to the Resistance Sapper (Attohwa) again to complete the quest and receive your reward.' },
        },
    },
