            { 'He gives the quest requiring 3 Rabbit Hide and 1 Raaz Tusk.', sub = {
                { 'Snowpelt Rabbits in Kamihr Drifts do NOT drop Rabbit Hide; local Cicatricose Raaz do drop tusks.' },
                { 'Serac Rabbits in Woh Gates (adjacent to Kamihr Drifts) drop Rabbit Hide.' },
                { 'Cletae in Southern San d\'Oria (D-8) sells Rabbit Hide for 80g.' },
                { 'If you have Key Item Baby rabbit memento from Monster Rearing, your Green Thumb Moogle also sells Rabbit Hide.' },
            } },
            { 'Trade all four items to Traiffeaux.', sub = {
                { 'Windower/Ashita users may get a black screen after the trade — shut down and reload without Windower/Ashita to complete the cutscene (verified working as of 16 March 2026).' },
