                { 'Recommended ranged trusts: Apururu, Semih Lafihna, Tenzen II, Makki-Chebukki, etc.' },
            } },
            { 'After defeating Deranged Ameretat, examine the Ergon Locus ??? a third time for a cutscene.', sub = {
