            { 'After waiting for the next game day after completing the Ygnas Directive, speak with Ploh Trishbahk at the Castle Adoulin gates (K-9).' },
            { 'Answer a series of paired questions by Fremilla about each of the six parts of the Ygnas Directive.', sub = {
                { 'Incorrect answer: Fremilla asks you to take it seriously and gives another chance.' },
                { 'Too many failures sends you away — re-speak to Ploh Trishbahk to retry, no zoning required.' },
            } },
            { 'After the questions, Fremilla requests a sweet to help cheer up Arciela.', sub = {
                { 'Possibly requested: Chocolate Crepe and White Honey (when bond is good, unconfirmed), or Midwinter Dream (when bond is bad, unconfirmed).' },
                { 'Runje Desaali sells the sweets after exhausting her Ygnas Insignia dialog ("What\'s with the leafkin?", "What does Geosuke recommend?") — only while this quest is active.' },
                { 'Chocolate Crepe — 10,000 bayld from Runje, or 500g from Curio Moogle.' },
                { 'White Honey — 1,000 bayld from Runje.' },
                { 'Midwinter Dream — 500,000 bayld from Runje, also on the AH.' },
            } },
            { 'Set The Arciela Directive Records of Eminence Objective.' },
            { 'Trade the requested sweets to Ploh Trishbahk to complete the Records of Eminence Objective.' },
            { 'Receive title Servant to the Servant and 50 Pinches of High-Purity Bayld.' },
            { 'Examine the Sandy Overlook at (J-10) in Ceizak Battlegrounds for a cutscene.', sub = {
                { 'Frontier Bivouac #1 is the closest warp from the castle\'s waypoint.' },
            } },
            { 'Receive Key Item: Ygnas\'s leaf and the ability to call forth his Alter Ego.' },
        },
    },
