            { 'To optimize time, bank imprimaturs in other coalition assignments (canceling returns them) until you can do 6-7 runs in a row (20+ imprimaturs) to complete Petitioner rank.', sub = {
                { 'If one person holds the slug, you can clear the assignment, Warp II to Western Adoulin HP #1, Waypoint #3 to Mummers, turn in / get a new assignment, Waypoint to Eastern Adoulin #4, and re-enter, repeating until rank up.' },
